                    <tr> 
                      <td bgcolor="#000000" height="23"><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#000000"><font color="#e1e1e1">Please do, but don't think we're going to back down due to lesser numbers.  Last night we cleared Umbral Plains with 2 level 60 neutral monks attempting to train our force.  They died, we planned better than the neutral team, and in the end our success was domination.  With the help of < Nine > and other assorted evil stragglers, the neutrals logged for the night with their corpses at our feet.  Right on evils!</P><P>More updates coming soon...(not by me, i'm just trying to fill our news page)</font></font></td>
